`apps_data_init()` returns a pointer to the global `AppsData` structure, which serves as the diskless fallback registry for applications. When the system cannot access the disk-based `apps/index` record, the runtime uses this structure to discover and load `.qa` archives via the `Apps.*` namespace instead of reading them on demand from the log.

