In FP-RISC, a linked list node is created using `Mem.alloc` sized by the target type, then initialized via helper functions like `Node.at`, `Node.setValue`, and `Node.setNext`. The sum of values is computed recursively by checking for null termination with `Node.isNull` and accumulating values using `Node.value`.

```fprisc
Node = Layout { value : Int, next : Node, tag : U8 }.

mkNode v = n = Node.at (Mem.alloc (Node.sizeOf Unit)); Node.setValue n v; n;
sum n acc = case Node.isNull n of True -> acc | False -> sum (Node.next n) (acc + Node.value n).

