Why does this implementation fail to meet the security requirements demonstrated in the `leg_input` test, specifically regarding the handling of surrogate pairs (emojis), and how should it be corrected?

```sol
actor bump() {
  send('Bump', 1);
  until(has(m, '"11"'));
