// ... critical section ...
CPU.irqRestore(mie)
```

Use `CPU.irqSave` to clear the machine interrupt enable bit and retrieve the previous value as an integer, then use `CPU.irqRestore` with that integer to restore the original state. These operations use tagged integers as tokens and do not automatically manage lexical critical sections or disable non-maskable interrupts.

