```fprisc
stop p = case p of Poller a ->
  me = myself 0;
  if A.sendSure me a (Stop me) then
    m = receiveFrom me a;
    _ = drop m;
    Unit
  else Unit.
```

The `stop` operation returns `Unit` and performs a send-receive cycle to ensure the stop signal is delivered to the Poller's owner. It sends a `Stop` message to the Poller using `sendSure`, then receives and discards the corresponding confirmation message via `receiveFrom`.

