  s = AC.spawnWith cap (sink me g);
  _ = AC.sendOrDie g s;
  ok = burst s 1 n 0;
  _ = AC.sendOrDie g ok;
  (k, ordered) = receiveFrom me s;
  (ok, k, ordered).
```

