obj.sendArc(to, count = 1); // Sender's share created
obj.sendArc(to, count = 1); // Receiver's share added
// Sender dies, obj survives due to pin
obj.sendArc(to, count = 1); // Third holder added
obj.drop(); // First holder releases
obj.drop(); // Second holder releases
// Object still exists until third holder drops
obj.drop(); // Final release
```

