```sol
attachAll = {
    read apps/index;
    for each id in apps/index do {
        read apps/<id>.qa;
        append records;
        Plug.attach bytes;
    }
}
```

The Sol scripting profile defines a `GET` method that returns a 200 status code and the requested value as a tuple. For example, the function `get_kv` retrieves a value by key:

