In the context of `Live.serve`, a "Unit cache" refers to the specific type of cache used to adapt the old stateless view to the new session-based path. It is a minimal cache that retains only the necessary output and next cache data without holding the full evolving state of a writer actor. This design ensures compatibility with the existing protocol while enabling memoization without introducing wire protocol changes.

