```sol
// Example of the QLOG append-only discipline
log.append(QCHK npages=1 len=1024 actorchunks/12345)
// Later, when actor 12345 is reloaded:
// The system reads the latest QCHK for 12345 and appends nothing to the log.
// The old QCHK entry is logically dead and reclaimed by GC.
```

