You must enforce the atomicity of the checkout by executing a single Sol transaction that contains the stock decrement, receipt generation, and revenue update logic. This ensures that either all three operations succeed together or none occur, satisfying the invariant that stock and financial records remain consistent.

```sol
sol {
  checkout(product: Product, payment: Payment) -> Receipt {
    // Attempt atomic update of stock, revenue, and receipt generation
    // If any step fails, the entire transaction rolls back
