```sol
func intercept(attacker, defender, overwatcher) {
    if (abs(attacker.col - overwatcher.col) <= 1) {
        return (attacker.atk * 0.5)
    }
    return 0
}
```

Overwatch allows a unit to spend AP to prevent attacks from enemies in the same column within ±1, dealing 50% of the attacker's ATK before the attack resolves. This effect lasts until the unit attacks, retreats, or is destroyed. Here is a Sol script example for a unit with the Overwatch tag:

