The `pushOne` function returns a new session state `Cs` where the `model` field has been updated to the result of the G.render operation (specifically `s2`), while all other fields (`reg`, `port`, `cfg`, `app`, `cid`, `mode`, `buf`, `sid`, and `ls`) remain unchanged from the input `st`. This updated state is then passed to `connLoop` to continue the rendering loop.

