```sol
// Example of a closed algebraic driver interface for UART
// Operations: start, stop, read, write
// Properties: Identity (start followed by stop is neutral), Associativity (grouping of reads/writes)
{
  uart_start: func -> void
  uart_stop:  func -> void
  uart_read:  func -> byte
  uart_write: func -> byte
}
```

