```

The design decision prioritizes a branch-light execution path by evaluating the predicate without per-element taken/not-taken branches, using SIMD lanes or cmov to write a mask column. This fused approach avoids the performance poisoning caused by branching on a wide path, while density is later restored via an explicit `Vec.compact` call or automatically at `Sys.poolReset`.

