```fprisc
keepEven x = x - (x / 2) * 2 == 0.

a1 = fillI (Vec.new Unit) 1 1000;
h0 = heapUsed Unit;
a2 = Vec.filter keepEven a1;
h1 = heapUsed Unit;

-- h1 - h0 should be less than 4096 bytes, proving in-place compaction
```

