The system validates cart quantities against current stock levels, rejecting requests that exceed availability and issuing a "warn" toast with the adjusted quantity. In Sol, this logic can be implemented by checking the stock count and comparing it to the requested amount, then updating the cart quantity if necessary and triggering a toast notification.

