The file `fprisc/sol/examples/csvmatrix.sol` demonstrates core matrix manipulation capabilities within the FP-RISC Sol scripting profile, including CSV parsing, row and column selection, element-wise mapping, matrix multiplication, and result serialization. It specifically highlights the JIT execution path by processing a large matrix (50,000x3) to prove that cell-level operations are optimized for performance.

