atKey = play quiet (kRight :: kRight :: kRight :: kRight :: kRight :: kRight :: kRight :: kDown :: kDown :: Nil);
locked = R.key atDoor kAct;
opened = play locked (kLeft :: kRight :: kAct :: Nil);
```

