To retrieve and modify a vector element in FP-RISC, you first use `Vec.get` with an index to obtain a record and its vector reference. You can then access specific fields of the record (e.g., `.x`) and use `Vec.push` to insert a new record containing updated values back into the vector. Finally, `Vec.get` is used again on the modified vector to verify the new value.

