The module uses a "NEWEST ATTACHMENT WINS" strategy where the new version sits alongside the old one without W^X or GOT, meaning a resolve is a table walk and a call is a PAP apply. This allows in-flight calls into the old image to run to completion without being unmapped, ensuring safety across the boundary.

