`Plug.attach` is the low-level operation that loads a versioned module file (`.qa`) into a plugin sub-slot of the running image and registers it in the module table, allowing the new version to coexist with the old one without W^X protections. `Mod.find` is a higher-level mechanism used after an attach that resolves a name to the newest attached version, ensuring that in-flight calls to the old image complete successfully while subsequent calls resolve to the new code.

```fpr
