_ = expectOk "load v2" (LD.load me ld "mathv2");
_ = send w (Reload "mathv2");
```

To trigger a hot swap, you must first load the new function into the loader using `LD.load`, then send a `Reload` message to the worker actor with the name of the new function. The worker detects this message and re-binds its internal function to the new one while preserving the accumulator.

```fprisc
LD.load me ld "mathv2";
