```fprisc
// Example logic illustrating the donation and preservation of stamp
if (backlog_size > DONATE_HI) {
    donated_actor = dequeue_oldest(backlog); // Oldest entry selected
    enqueue_to_machine_fifo(donated_actor); // Preserves original stamp
}
```

