The design avoids per-element branching by evaluating the predicate branchlessly using cmov or SIMD lanes, which prevents poisoning the wide execution path. Scans such as map, fold, and zip fuse the mask by reading it as a lane selector. Density is later restored via an explicit `Vec.compact` call or automatically at `Sys.poolReset`, moving the compaction policy to the program rather than the vector operation itself.

