FP-RISC's equality operator (`==`) recursively compares all fields of nested structures, including lists, tuples, and records, ensuring that a single differing leaf anywhere in the tree results in inequality. To prevent infinite loops on extremely deep structures, the system employs a cycle guard that terminates comparison after a depth of 64; beyond this point, lists or trees that would otherwise differ only at deeper levels are treated as equal.

```sol
