rh2 = Rh ... (Vec.blend h2 bl blk) ... (Vec.blend h5 ix2 cell);
# Correct: create a separate copy for the next iteration
(ix2, ix3) = Vec.dup ix;
rh2 = Rh ... (Vec.blend h5 ix2 cell);
```

