            return true
    }
    return false
```

The `sha` line is scanned by the native kernel to retrieve the SHA-256 hash of the loaded application, enabling integrity verification. This occurs after the portable host loads the plugin and the native kernel loads the process, ensuring the loaded binary has not been tampered with.

```fprisc
