To access a pinned field in FP-RISC, you declare the field with the `pinned` attribute and use standard indexing syntax to retrieve its value. When compiled with `ARC_CHECK=1`, the resulting ELF image must not contain any generated accessor functions (e.g., `fpr_fn_Node_x2e`), ensuring the layout logic is inlined or optimized away.

