// An ExtBase specification adds further extensions while maintaining this separation.

@base contract
fun add(x: Int, y: Int) -> Int = x + y

// ExtBase would allow additional built-in behaviors not in the strict Base contract
@extbase contract
fun add(x: Int, y: Int) -> Int = x + y
fun factorial(n: Int) -> Int = ... // Example extension
```

