}

script myscript {
  print x;
}

Effects from actor threads belong to the shared transaction, so the script must not reach its end while a worker still holds unsent effects. To ensure proper completion, the worker must send a done message, and the main script must receive this acknowledgment before executing its final statement.

```sol
spawn ActorWorker(args) {
    // ... worker logic ...
    sendFrom main "done";
}
receiveFrom main "done" {
    // Continue here; effects are now committed.
}
```

