    trigger_intercept();
}
```

Overwatch triggers only when an enemy attacks a friendly unit or HQ within ±1 lanes, dealing 50% of the attacker's ATK before the attack resolves. Ambush triggers when an enemy attacks the forward unit in the ambush's column or the ambush card itself, dealing full ATK before resolution. While Overwatch is a passive state maintained by holding AP, Ambush requires an enemy attack to reveal the card and deal damage, after which the card remains face-up in the rear.

