ys = Rc.retain xs;
```

Raw floats are prohibited because they carry untagged bits that generic traversal cannot distinguish from references, creating a risk of incorrect ownership handling. Actors are excluded because the message-lifetime ARC mechanism used by actors is a separate system and is not linked into the build containing this explicit reclamation API. Attempting to use these types can lead to undefined behavior or crashes, as the API assumes strict, taggable ownership semantics that these types violate.

```sol
