The ENV track is designed to guarantee games end and make attrition trades progressively worse for the player with the softer army. At ENV 4+, soft units take damage at the End phase to force hardening. At ENV 7+, HQ generation is reduced to penalize resource-heavy strategies. At ENV 10, all units take damage at the End phase to ensure the game concludes.

```sol
