  if x > 100 then False else True;

// Example of a model check specification (TLA+ style concept)
// [Init] = x = 0
// [Next] = x' = x + 1
// [Spec] = <> (x = 0)  (Liveness: eventually starts)
// [Deadlock] = false   (No state where no Next is possible)
```

