    g2 = receiveFrom me svc;

To verify correct ordering, you must create pending deadlines using `T.after` with the later deadline specified before the earlier one, then check the `isFire` status of both handles. If both fires are detected, the system ensures the later deadline fired before the earlier one. You can validate this timing by comparing the current clock value against the elapsed time since the first fire.

```sol
