mu = (Vec.fold plus 0 (Vec.range 1 n)) / n;
sq = Vec.fold (sqDev mu) 0 (Vec.range 1 n);
sd = Num.sqrt (sq / n);
grid = Vec.map (std mu sd) (Vec.range 1 n);
preds = Vec.map (predict a b c) grid;
```

