The Rc allocator is restricted to intra-actor usage and relies on plain store operations for incrementing and decrementing reference counts at existing safepoints. When the reference count drops to zero, the allocator executes `dealloc` immediately; it never crosses actor boundaries and contains no concurrent logic.

