```sol
// Correct initialization pattern
fpr_pool_init(pool_id, size, alignment);
```

The `fpr_pool_init` function was introduced to centralize memory allocation initialization for all five pool creation sites, ensuring that every pool routes through a unified setup routine. This change fixes the Sys.arena uninitialized-bigfree bug by guaranteeing that the arena's state is properly initialized before any memory operations occur.

