```sol
// Example setting an entity to be translucent
entity my_entity = {
    color = (255, 0, 0, 500), // Alpha 500 < 1000 makes it translucent
    mesh = "tank/hull"
}
```

To make a mesh instance translucent, set its alpha component in the color tuple to a value below 1000. The rendering pipeline handles this by drawing all opaque instances first, followed by all translucent instances and text glyphs, which are sorted from far to near and blended together.

